{"parse": {"title": "凡人或英雄-08", "pageid": 147022, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%87%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84-07\" title=\"凡人或英雄-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">凡人或英雄-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">凡人或英雄</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8D.83.E5.B9.B4.E8.B5.8C.E5.B1.80\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"千年赌局\">千年赌局</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 千年赌局</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Agon of the Ages</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天色早已放晴，宽广的海面上仍旧没有任何人影。凯迈昂人围在海岸边，焦急不安地等待着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-636920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-636920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-636920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">族人：</div><div>为什么他们还没有回来？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">长老：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">长老：</div><div>再等等。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-510720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-510720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-510720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">族人：</div><div>你们快看——那是什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝白相交的天际线上，远远出现了一条巨大的鲸鱼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刻托的背部赫然站着一位红发的战士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">长老：</div><div>是赫多涅！赫多涅回来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-636920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-636920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-636920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">族人：</div><div>赫多涅回来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刻托越游越快，迅速接近了外围岛屿的岸边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>族人们看清了赫多涅现在的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她浑身是伤，满脸都是干涸的血迹。黄金如液体般在她的身上流淌，披风如同燃烧着的火焰本身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-636820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-636820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-636820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">族人：</div><div>这简直是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-636820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-636820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-636820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">族人：</div><div>这简直是真正的女神！我们的帕拉斯，辛西娅，野兽的女主人，胜利女神！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅跳下刻托，将手中的提丰之眼高高举起，高声呼喊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315633.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-315633.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315633.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315633.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-315633.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315633.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-315633.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315633.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我们杀死了提丰！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315633.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-315633.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315633.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315633.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-315633.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315633.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-315633.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315633.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我们胜利了，我们可以住在这里了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群中一片死寂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-636820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-636820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-636820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">族人：</div><div>赫多涅！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不知谁最先开始称颂了赫多涅的名字，所有凯迈昂人都开始流泪和欢呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群狂热地涌到她身边，比提丰的飓风还要猛烈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-636920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-636920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-636920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">族人：</div><div>赫多涅！赫多涅！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>终于，有人问出了那个被遗漏的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-510720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-510720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-510720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">族人：</div><div>其他战士呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……他们牺牲了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>他们与提丰英勇地战斗了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">长老：</div><div>……果然和“预言”所说的一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>什么“预言”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">长老：</div><div>欧洛斯所做的最后的“预言”。他嘱托我们在你归来前保密，这是他最后的安排。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>长老面对激动的族人，张开了双臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">长老：</div><div>诸位，诚如“预言”所言：英雄们将为新的家园牺牲，赫多涅——我们的希望，将带着提丰的眼睛凯旋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">长老：</div><div>她已经证明了自己无可匹敌的力量，她将成为我们凯迈昂人新的国王！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">长老：</div><div>这便是诸神的意志！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">长老：</div><div>赫多涅殿下万岁！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">族人们：</div><div>赫多涅殿下！赫多涅殿下！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>凯迈昂人爆发出了更高的欢呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人从她手里拿走了提丰之眼；有人为她捧来金色的奖牌，为她戴上沉重的金环装饰。孩子们开心地笑着，将鲜艳的花朵和葡萄丢在她脚下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>真正的“神”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在人群中再一次看到了那个小小的、红发的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>恭喜，赫多涅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>病弱的诗人挤出人群，激动地握住赫多涅的双手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诗人：</div><div>这一切都让我想起了许久之前……神明降临在我们族中那天！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诗人：</div><div>我要为此创作一首长诗——一幅壁画！赞颂我们勇武的女王！我们的英雄！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诗人：</div><div>诸神啊，我们凯迈昂人……凯迈昂人终于复兴了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_daoyukefang\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_daoyukefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-635820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">长老：</div><div>围绕着提丰之眼的壁画创作刚刚结束。殿下，请看这份摹本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一幅精妙的临摹在赫多涅眼前展开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哈，不错，每个人都画得很像。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提丰之战的五年后，一切都回归平稳。长老汇报完毕，行礼离开了王厅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>王者坐回桌前，准备翻阅下一份卷轴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只陌生的手按住了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>如今，这座岛上到处都是竞技和比赛……一种战争的劣等替代品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>“毕竟这关乎激情与欢庆，而不关乎生死”……我很难想象你竟会同意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>这实在是有些无聊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我无需征得你的同意，也没有必要考虑你的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方坐到桌上，拿起了餐盘里的一颗葡萄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>哎，你整日坐在桌前，甚至没时间摸一摸弓！五年了，我才又一次在赛场上看到了你搭弓射箭的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>不过，我能理解。岛外的世界战火四起，隐蔽岛屿和挑选航线都需要精力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>你们有太多战士被提丰杀死了，下一代还需要十几年才能担起责任，那时你才有竞技与航海的自由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅签完自己的名字，将新一卷政令卷起，垒在桌案的书堆上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>不过，这样真的好吗，隐瞒朋友曾对你刀剑相向的事实，模糊那些由虚荣导致的死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我没有隐瞒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>是啊，只是没有特意说明。“他们仍是凯迈昂人的英雄。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>……或是像那位长老说的一样：“英雄故事需要纯粹。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>所有的事，我赫多涅一人便可以承担。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>他们的死，说到底是你的阴谋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山转过头，饶有兴味地观察她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我对你们并无喜恶。我只是追求着最纯粹的乐趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>旁观新城邦的建立，也是一种乐趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>但我不确定这个乐趣可以在我心中维持多久……或许，一千年？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅从文书中抬起头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>如果你是来挑衅我的，可以去议会排队。那里有报名切磋的手续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>但如果你想对我的子民出手。哪怕是神明，我也会刺伤你的手掌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山对她摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我只是来和你告别。裁判还是在赛场之外比较好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我是你的少年时代，一个影子，一个追逐着纯粹力量和乐趣的孩童。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>但她在你心里已经逐渐远去……我也无法再使用这种形象出现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我没有变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>下一次，我会纠正你扭曲了的命运——哪怕是千年之后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩的身形在日光中飘散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>千年后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>提丰会杀死你吗，或是你会为提丰所杀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>你会再次失去所有的朋友吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我很期待这场千年赌局的结果——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>如果你还记得的话，轮回者。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"sufubihaozhaiyewan\"><img alt=\"sufubihaozhaiyewan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png/600px-Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png/900px-Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png/1200px-Cg-sufubihaozhaiyewan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>日光黯淡，已是黄昏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">园丁：</div><div>赫多涅殿下，赫多涅殿下？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315631.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-315631.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315631.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315631.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-315631.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315631.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-315631.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315631.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">园丁：</div><div>很抱歉吵醒您。但您又有一位访客，他说要和您讨论明天预言仪式的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅看向窗外：所有的草坪都被修剪得十分整齐，仿佛是被巨力从头到尾一斧劈开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>草坪之后，熟悉的金发青年对着她挥了挥手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315632.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-315632.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315632.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315632.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-315632.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315632.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-315632.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315632.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>那个学者呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">园丁：</div><div>哦，她啊——她早就走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">园丁：</div><div>您不是说您累了，要小憩一会儿，所以才请她离开的吗？您说明天再和她聊聊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315632.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-315632.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315632.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315632.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-315632.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315632.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-315632.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315632.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>是吗？我刚醒，脑子还有些乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-561220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">园丁：</div><div>您做了个什么梦？我好像听见您在大喊大叫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315632.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-315632.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315632.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315632.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-315632.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315632.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-315632.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315632.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>梦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梦的内容如同水汽一样蒸发无踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315628.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315628.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我不记得了。这说明我的休息质量还不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅撑起身子，在沙发上活动了一下关节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>告诉阿波罗，我这就来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>这一次，我会彻底终结千年前的一切。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "凡人或英雄-08"}}